-#### Google Gemini (Antigravity OAuth)
+Copy and paste this prompt to your LLM agent (Claude Code, AmpCode, Cursor, etc.):
 
-First, add the opencode-antigravity-auth plugin:
-
-```json
-{
-  "plugin": [
